  << /ActualText (\055 Designed product experiences across XDR\054 SIEM\054 and shared platform initiatives\056\n\055 Helped shape XDR from the early stages as a new product\056\n\055 Led a full redesign of SIEM using design system foundations\056\n\055 Defined platform UX patterns and shared foundations for product integration\056\n\055 Designed shared platform areas including asset management\054 dashboards\054 reports\054 and tasks\056\n\055 Worked closely with the design system team and engineers on reusable components and scalable UX foundations\056\n\055 Improved design quality through formalized design review processes and ongoing design QA\056\n\055 Collaborated with product managers\054 analysts\054 architects\054 engineers\054 and domain experts from early problem framing to implementation\056)
